nematic moment you know like  the kind of like  thing that would be in a movie where you  know  and that night after the premiere and at  the after party i  collapsed and that was something that's  happened frequently in my life usually  corresponding with a panic attack  during the interview elliott reveals he  also had similar experiences  on the press tour for 2007's juno and  while attending the oscars  where he was nominated for his role in  the film but since coming out in  december  the umbrella academy star shares that he  now feels a great responsibility in  sharing his truth  so much of the privilege i have the  ability to  be here sitting here right now is really  because of so many  trans women of color who have  consistently put their lives on the line  throughout history  i'm grateful to have the access to the  resources i've  i've had because i don't know what would  have happened if  i didn't i don't know how to really say  it other than it just  feels more important than  feeling scared in moments it feels more  important than  if i have an overwhelming day  it to me s really simply feels like  absolutely the right thing to do  you
 

